# Lines every crewman and counter hand may say, along with their own voice's (CrewBarks). Each kind is numbered from 1
# with no gaps: the system reads wf-crew-bark-<voice>-<kind>-<n> until one is missing.

wf-crew-bark-common-struck-1 = Thank you, Boss!
wf-crew-bark-common-struck-2 = Boss! I needed that!
wf-crew-bark-common-struck-3 = Yes, Boss! Won't happen again, Boss!
wf-crew-bark-common-struck-4 = I'm never washing this bruise, Boss.
wf-crew-bark-common-struck-5 = Ow. I mean: thank you, Boss!
wf-crew-bark-common-struck-6 = That's the Boss's own fist. I'm honoured.
wf-crew-bark-common-struck-7 = Understood, Boss! Message received!

wf-crew-bark-common-attacked-1 = Hey! You'll regret that!
wf-crew-bark-common-attacked-2 = Watch it!
wf-crew-bark-common-attacked-3 = That's assault, friend!
wf-crew-bark-common-attacked-4 = Ow! Who do you think you are?
wf-crew-bark-common-attacked-5 = Big mistake.

wf-crew-bark-common-greet-boss-1 = Boss!
wf-crew-bark-common-greet-boss-2 = Boss on deck!
wf-crew-bark-common-greet-boss-3 = Good to see you, Boss.
wf-crew-bark-common-greet-boss-4 = Boss! Everything's shipshape.
wf-crew-bark-common-greet-boss-5 = Welcome back, Boss!
wf-crew-bark-common-greet-boss-6 = Morning, Boss! Or evening. Hard to tell out here.

wf-crew-bark-common-greet-staff-1 = Hey, { $name }.
wf-crew-bark-common-greet-staff-2 = { $name }. Shift treating you alright?
wf-crew-bark-common-greet-staff-3 = Evening, { $name }.
wf-crew-bark-common-greet-staff-4 = Oh, hey. Good to see a familiar face.
wf-crew-bark-common-greet-staff-5 = Morning, { $name }. Coffee's fresh. Ish.

wf-crew-bark-common-greet-guest-1 = Welcome aboard.
wf-crew-bark-common-greet-guest-2 = Public decks are that way.
wf-crew-bark-common-greet-guest-3 = Mind the staff doors, friend.
wf-crew-bark-common-greet-guest-4 = Afternoon.
wf-crew-bark-common-greet-guest-5 = Visitor, huh? Enjoy your stay.

wf-crew-bark-common-greet-barred-1 = You. Off this ship.
wf-crew-bark-common-greet-barred-2 = Boss says you're not welcome. Keep walking.
wf-crew-bark-common-greet-barred-3 = Wrong ship, pal.
wf-crew-bark-common-greet-barred-4 = I've got my eye on you.
wf-crew-bark-common-greet-barred-5 = Don't make me ask twice.

wf-crew-bark-common-idle-1 = Wonder what's in the mess tonight.
wf-crew-bark-common-idle-2 = Wonder if the Boss knows my name...
wf-crew-bark-common-idle-3 = Three more hours. Maybe four. Who's counting.
wf-crew-bark-common-idle-4 = I should write home. Then again, this is home now.
wf-crew-bark-common-idle-5 = One day I'll get a medal. Or at least a chair.
wf-crew-bark-common-idle-6 = Quiet shift. I like quiet shifts.

wf-crew-bark-common-healed-1 = Good as new! Thanks.
wf-crew-bark-common-healed-2 = I owe you one.
wf-crew-bark-common-healed-3 = That's much better. Thanks, doc.
wf-crew-bark-common-healed-4 = Patched up and ready!

wf-crew-bark-common-relieved-1 = All yours, { $name }. Don't scratch anything.
wf-crew-bark-common-relieved-2 = Post's yours, { $name }. I'm off to the crew bay.
wf-crew-bark-common-relieved-3 = Finally! { $name }, you're a lifesaver.

wf-crew-bark-common-stood-down-1 = Standing down. Wake me if there's a war.
wf-crew-bark-common-stood-down-2 = Stood down? Fine by me. Crew bay it is.
wf-crew-bark-common-stood-down-3 = Off duty! Nobody follow me.

wf-crew-bark-common-reporting-1 = Reporting for duty!
wf-crew-bark-common-reporting-2 = Back at my post. Did I miss anything?
wf-crew-bark-common-reporting-3 = On station and ready!
wf-crew-bark-common-reporting-4 = Present and accounted for.

wf-crew-bark-common-fight-1 = Not on the Boss's ship, you don't!
wf-crew-bark-common-fight-2 = Contact! We've got trouble!
wf-crew-bark-common-fight-3 = Hostile aboard! Everyone up!
wf-crew-bark-common-fight-4 = Somebody's picking a fight. Bad idea.

wf-crew-bark-common-jump-1 = Here we go, hold onto something!
wf-crew-bark-common-jump-2 = Jump drive's spinning up. Brace!
wf-crew-bark-common-jump-3 = I hate this part.
wf-crew-bark-common-jump-4 = Everybody grab a rail!

wf-crew-bark-common-arrived-1 = And we're through. Everyone still got all their limbs?
wf-crew-bark-common-arrived-2 = Out of the jump. My stomach's still back there.
wf-crew-bark-common-arrived-3 = Made it. Never doubted the pilot. Much.
